secr <https://cran.r-project.org/package=secr> 5.3.0
is now on CRAN.  There is new functionality for modelling spatial
variation in detection parameters lambda0 and sigma (see secr-detectionxy.pdf <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/detectionxy.pdf>)
and for relative density models. Simulation of Ornstein-Uhlenbeck
movement and detection with functions simOU() and simOU.capthist() has
been moved from package secrdesign.

